#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:91
msgid ""
"Each Streamit program is fed by a YouTube playlist: the new videos of the "
"playlist are imported as episodes of the program."
msgstr ""
"Cada programa de Streamit se alimenta de una playlist de YouTube: los videos"
" nuevos de la playlist se importan como episodios del programa."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:94
msgid "Filter the list by name or playlist…"
msgstr "Filtrar la lista por nombre o playlist…"

