msgstr "+ Agregar programa"

#. translators: %s: the “+ Add program” button label
#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:117
msgid ""
"There are no programs yet. Press %s, choose the Streamit program, paste its "
"playlist and save."
msgstr ""
"Todavía no hay programas. Presiona %s, elige el programa de Streamit, pega "
"su playlist y guarda."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:122
msgid "<strong>Streamit program:</strong> type to search."
msgstr "<strong>Programa de Streamit:</strong> escribe para buscar."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:123
msgid ""
"<strong>Active:</strong> turn the checkmark off to stop syncing a program "
"without deleting it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Activo:</strong> quita la palomita para dejar de sincronizar un "
"programa sin borrarlo."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:124
msgid ""
"<strong>Season:</strong> empty = always the last one (if there is none, "
"“Season 1” is created)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Temporada:</strong> vacío = siempre la última (si no hay, se crea "
"«Temporada 1»)."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:125
msgid ""
"<strong>Videos to import:</strong> “All new videos” or “Only the ones I "
"choose”; with <strong>Choose videos</strong> you see the playlist and check "
"which ones. Videos that are already in Streamit are skipped automatically."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Videos a importar:</strong> «Todos los nuevos» o «Solo los que "
"elija»; con <strong>Elegir videos</strong> ves la playlist y marcas cuáles. "
"Los videos que ya están en Streamit se omiten solos."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:126
msgid ""
"<strong>Sync</strong> (on each row) imports only that program, even if it is"
" disabled, with what you last saved."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Sincronizar</strong> (en cada fila) importa solo ese programa, "
"incluso si está desactivado, con lo último que guardaste."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:129
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importación"

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:131
msgid "Import videos from"
msgstr "Importar videos desde"

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:132
msgid ""
"Only videos published on YouTube from this date on are imported (avoids "
"bringing in the whole history)."
msgstr ""
"Solo se importan videos publicados en YouTube desde esta fecha (evita traer "
"todo el historial)."

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:133
msgid "Status when importing"
msgstr "Estado al importar"

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:135
msgid "Draft (I review)"
msgstr "Borrador (yo reviso)"

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:136
msgid "Published automatically"
msgstr "Publicado automáticamente"

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:141 includes/admin/page-settings.php:77
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Guardar cambios"

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:142 includes/admin/page-tools.php:20
msgid "Sync now"
msgstr "Sincronizar ahora"

#: includes/admin/page-programs.php:143
msgid "Save before syncing."
msgstr "Guarda antes de sincronizar."

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:17
msgid "Manual actions"
msgstr "Acciones manuales"

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:21
msgid ""
"Checks YouTube and creates the new episodes of all <strong>active</strong> "
"programs, without waiting for the automatic task."
msgstr ""
"Revisa YouTube y crea los episodios nuevos de todos los programas "
"<strong>activos</strong>, sin esperar a la tarea automática."

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:22
msgid "Diagnostic (creates nothing)"
msgstr "Diagnóstico (no crea nada)"

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:23
msgid ""
"Shows what a sync would do (which videos it would import and which it skips,"
" and why), without creating anything."
msgstr ""
"Muestra qué haría una sincronización (qué videos importaría y cuáles omite y"
" por qué), sin crear nada."

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:24
msgid "Repair links"
msgstr "Reparar enlaces"

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:25
msgid ""
"Links to their program and season the imported episodes that do not appear "
"inside the program."
msgstr ""
"Enlaza a su programa y temporada los episodios importados que no aparecen "
"dentro del programa."

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:26
msgid "Fill durations"
msgstr "Completar duraciones"

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:27
msgid ""
"Reads the duration of the videos from YouTube and fills the “Episode Time "
"Duration” (hours:minutes) of the episodes that have it empty. It needs the "
"YouTube API key."
msgstr ""
"Lee la duración de los videos en YouTube y completa la «duración del "
"episodio» (horas:minutos) de los episodios que la tienen vacía. Necesita la "
"API key de YouTube."

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:28
msgid ""
"Also include episodes that were loaded before (detected by their YouTube "
"video)"
msgstr ""
"Incluir también los episodios cargados antes (detectados por su video de "
"YouTube)"

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:29
msgid "Send test email"
msgstr "Enviar correo de prueba"

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:30
msgid ""
"Sends an email to the notification address to confirm it arrives (check spam"
" too)."
msgstr ""
"Envía un correo al destino de los avisos para confirmar que llega (revisa "
"también spam)."

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:34
msgid "View Streamit fields"
msgstr "Ver campos de Streamit"

#: includes/admin/page-tools.php:35
msgid ""
"Shows the saved fields of an episode or a program. Useful to check how "
"Streamit stores its data."
msgstr ""
"Muestra los campos guardados de un episodio o de un programa. Útil para "
"revisar cómo guarda Streamit sus datos."

