#: includes/translation-strings.php:14
msgid ""
"Automatically imports the videos of YouTube playlists as Streamit episodes "
"and sends an email notice when a program reaches an episode number. "
"Independent project, not affiliated with Iqonic or Streamit."
msgstr ""
"Importa automáticamente los videos de playlists de YouTube como episodios de"
" Streamit y avisa por correo al llegar a un capítulo. Proyecto "
"independiente, no afiliado a Iqonic ni a Streamit."

#: includes/durations.php:75
msgid "A YouTube API key is required to read the durations (Settings)."
msgstr "Se necesita la API key de YouTube para leer las duraciones (Ajustes)."

#: includes/durations.php:99
msgid "Durations: there is nothing to fill."
msgstr "Duraciones: no hay nada que completar."

